{"availability":"available","full":"omarcosr/tarve","name":"tarve","description":"Native desktop GUI framework for Bun + TypeScript/TSX. Retained UI, native rendering, no browser, DOM, or React runtime. Windows & Linux.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Rust","stars":21,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-21T19:13:21Z","updated":"2026-10-02T21:16:23Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":["bun","desktop","gui","linux","native","rust","taffy","tsx","typescript","ui-framework","vello","windows"],"demo":null,"color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:38:43.329Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T10:38:43.329Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T10:38:43.329Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:38:43.329Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T10:38:43.329Z","stars":21,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Tarve turns a TSX tree into a retained native interface. It does not use a browser, DOM, or React runtime. Layout is handled by Taffy, text shaping and editing by Parley, and rendering is selectable between GPU and low-memory CPU paths.","Current supported targets: Windows x64 and Linux x64 Runtime: Bun 1.4+ Package: @tarve/core (CLI: tarve) License: Apache-2.0"],"features":["Native TSX UI with a dedicated @tarve/core JSX runtime.","Retained Taffy Flexbox/Grid layout with incremental property and structural updates.","Parley text shaping, selection, clipboard (text, files, images), IME composition, native undo/redo, and Unicode-aware editing.","Native Windows D3D11/DXGI renderer with Vello/WGPU fallback; Linux uses Vello/WGPU. Both platforms provide a vellocpu + softbuffer CPU renderer.","shadcn-inspired components and semantic light/dark theme tokens."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/omarcosr/tarve/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e36d5c9e867830110d40b9094cfc72d350fedbbbfc2c6455c0cdbe7168a2f776","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T10:38:43.329Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10